<title>USA: Laser Industries gets FDA nod on system.</title>
<headline>Laser Industries gets FDA nod on system.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Laser Industries Ltd said Thrusday the U.S. Food and Drug Administration has granted the company marketing clearance for its computerized 2040 Erbium SilkLaser for use in incisions, excision, ablation, vaporization or coagulation of soft tissue in plastic and dermatological surgery.</p>
<p>The new computerized laser system, which the company expects to begin shipping in September, is for use in superficial skin resurfacing applications.</p>
